---
import { bookingEnabled } from '../../lib/order-shipping';
import { getShippingOrigin } from '../../lib/biteship';
const { order, shipment } = Astro.props;
let details: any = null;
let result: any = null;
try { details = JSON.parse(shipment?.snapshot || 'null'); result = JSON.parse(shipment?.provider_data || 'null'); } catch {}
let origin: ReturnType<typeof getShippingOrigin> | null = null;
try { origin = getShippingOrigin(); } catch {}
const eligible = order.status === 'paid' && order.paid_at && order.xendit_invoice_id;
const canBook = bookingEnabled() && eligible && ['ready', 'rejected'].includes(shipment?.state);
const needsReview = ['creating', 'review'].includes(shipment?.state);
const rp = (n: number) => 'Rp ' + Number(n).toLocaleString('id-ID');
const tracking = typeof result?.link === 'string' && result.link.startsWith('https://') ? result.link : null;
---
<section class="card shipping" data-admin-shipping data-order={order.id}>
  <h2>Pengiriman Instant</h2>
  <p class="shipping__notice">Ongkir sudah termasuk dalam total checkout pelanggan. Booking khusus admin setelah pembayaran terkonfirmasi dan rangkaian siap; tidak menagih pelanggan lagi.</p>
  <aside class="shipping__balance" aria-label="Catatan saldo dan ongkir">
    <p><strong>Siapkan saldo Biteship sebelum booking.</strong> Dana pembayaran pelanggan di Xendit tidak otomatis masuk ke saldo Biteship toko.</p>
    <details>
      <summary>Jika saldo kurang atau tarif ongkir berubah</summary>
      <p>Contoh: ongkir Rp60.000, saldo Biteship Rp10.000. Booking dapat ditolak karena saldo tidak cukup; kurir belum terpesan. Order pelanggan tetap paid, tanpa pembatalan atau refund Xendit otomatis.</p>
      <p>Top up saldo melalui dashboard Biteship. Setelah memastikan booking sebelumnya ditolak dan tidak ada pengiriman yang terbentuk, muat ulang order, cek tarif terbaru, lalu konfirmasi booking lagi. Top up tidak otomatis memesan kurir.</p>
      <p>Jika status creating/review, timeout, atau hasil belum pasti, jangan langsung pesan ulang. Cocokkan Reference ID di dashboard dan ikuti rekonsiliasi agar tidak terpesan dua kali.</p>
      <p>Jika pelanggan membayar ongkir Rp60.000 tetapi tarif terbaru Rp65.000, selisih Rp5.000 ditinjau dan disetujui toko sebelum booking. Sistem tidak otomatis menagih pelanggan lagi.</p>
    </details>
  </aside>
  {!shipment ? <p>Order pickup atau order lama tanpa data pin terstruktur. Booking CMS tidak tersedia; periksa pengiriman secara manual.</p> : <>
    <dl>
      <div><dt>Asal pickup</dt><dd>{details?.booking?.origin_contact_name || origin?.name}<br />{details?.booking?.origin_address || origin?.address}<br />Pin: {details?.booking?.origin_coordinate?.latitude ?? origin?.latitude}, {details?.booking?.origin_coordinate?.longitude ?? origin?.longitude}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Tujuan</dt><dd>{details?.address}<br />Pin: {details?.destination?.latitude}, {details?.destination?.longitude}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Layanan / tanggal diminta</dt><dd>{details?.courier} Instant / {details?.date || 'Belum dicantumkan'}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Ongkir dibayar pelanggan</dt><dd>{rp(order.shipping_cost)}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Reference ID</dt><dd>{shipment.reference_id}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Status booking CMS</dt><dd>{shipment.state}{shipment.provider_mode ? ` (${shipment.provider_mode})` : ''}</dd></div>
      {details?.booking && <div><dt>Kontak pada booking</dt><dd>Pickup: {details.booking.origin_contact_phone}<br />Penerima: {details.booking.destination_contact_name}, {details.booking.destination_contact_phone}<br />Dipesan oleh: {shipment.booked_by}</dd></div>}
      {result && <>
        <div><dt>ID Biteship / resi</dt><dd>{result.id} / {result.waybill || 'Belum terbit'}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Status kurir terakhir</dt><dd>{result.status}{result.price != null ? ` / ${rp(result.price)}` : ''}<br />Diperbarui: {new Date(shipment.updated_at).toLocaleString('id-ID', { timeZone: 'Asia/Jakarta' })} WIB</dd></div>
      </>}
    </dl>
    {tracking && <p><a href={tracking} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Lacak pengiriman</a></p>}
    {shipment.last_error && <p class="shipping__error">{shipment.last_error}</p>}
    {!bookingEnabled() && <p>Booking CMS belum diaktifkan. Pengelola perlu memeriksa konfigurasi sebelum operasional.</p>}
    {!eligible && !result && <p>Menunggu pembayaran terkonfirmasi Xendit. Status paid manual saja tidak mengaktifkan booking.</p>}
    {needsReview && <p class="shipping__error">Jangan membuat booking ulang. Cari Reference ID di dashboard Biteship dan cocokkan ID order. Status creating yang macet juga harus diperiksa.</p>}
    {canBook && <form data-quote-form>
      <div class="shipping__fields">
        <label>Nama penerima<input name="recipient" value={details?.booking?.destination_contact_name || order.customer_name} required maxlength="200" /></label>
        <label>WhatsApp penerima<input name="phone" type="tel" value={details?.booking?.destination_contact_phone || order.customer_phone} required maxlength="40" /></label>
      </div>
      <p>Data awal memakai kontak pemesan. Ganti bila penerima berbeda; pastikan alamat dan pin di atas sudah benar.</p>
      <button class="btn" type="submit">Cek tarif sebelum pesan</button>
    </form>}
    {(result || needsReview) && <form data-sync-form>
      {!result && <label>ID order Biteship untuk rekonsiliasi<input name="providerId" required placeholder="ID order dari dashboard, bukan nomor resi" /></label>}
      <button class="btn" type="submit">Sinkronkan status Biteship</button>
      <p>Sinkronisasi tidak membuat booking. Perubahan status website tidak membatalkan kurir atau melakukan refund. Pembatalan kurir melalui dashboard Biteship.</p>
    </form>}
  </>}
  <p data-shipping-message role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <dialog data-booking-dialog aria-labelledby="booking-title">
    <form data-booking-form>
      <h2 id="booking-title">Pesan Kurir Instant sekarang?</h2>
      <p data-review></p>
      <p><strong>Kurir akan diminta menjemput sekarang, bukan mengikuti tanggal permintaan secara otomatis. Tarif dapat berubah dan memakai saldo Biteship toko.</strong></p>
      <p>Pastikan saldo Biteship cukup. Dana Xendit tidak otomatis menjadi saldo Biteship; selisih tarif tidak menagih pelanggan lagi secara otomatis.</p>
      <label class="shipping__check"><input type="checkbox" required /> Saya sudah memeriksa tanggal, kontak pickup, penerima, alamat, pin, serta berat 1.500 gram per item; rangkaian siap dan muat dibawa motor. Selisih ongkir disetujui toko.</label>
      <div class="shipping__actions">
        <button class="btn" type="button" data-close-dialog>Kembali</button>
        <button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit" data-book>Pesan Kurir Instant</button>
      </div>
      <p data-dialog-message role="status"></p>
    </form>
  </dialog>
</section>
<script>
  const root = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-admin-shipping]');
  if (root) {
    const id = root.dataset.order;
    const message = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-shipping-message]')!;
    const dialog = root.querySelector<HTMLDialogElement>('[data-booking-dialog]')!;
    const bookingForm = root.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('[data-booking-form]')!;
    const dialogMessage = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-dialog-message]')!;
    const review = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-review]')!;
    let quoteToken = '';
    let busy = false;
    const request = async (body: unknown) => {
      const response = await fetch(`/api/admin/orders/${id}/shipping`, { method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(body) });
      const data = await response.json();
      if (!response.ok) throw new Error(data.error || 'Permintaan gagal.');
      return data;
    };
    const disable = (value: boolean) => {
      busy = value;
      root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('button').forEach(button => { button.disabled = value; });
    };
    root.querySelector('[data-close-dialog]')?.addEventListener('click', () => { if (!busy) dialog.close(); });
    dialog.addEventListener('cancel', event => { if (busy) event.preventDefault(); });
    root.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('[data-quote-form]')?.addEventListener('submit', async event => {
      event.preventDefault();
      if (busy) return;
      disable(true); message.textContent = 'Memeriksa tarif terbaru...';
      const form = new FormData(event.currentTarget as HTMLFormElement);
      try {
        const data = await request({ action: 'quote', name: form.get('recipient'), phone: form.get('phone') });
        quoteToken = data.token; bookingForm.reset(); dialogMessage.textContent = '';
        const money = (n: number) => 'Rp ' + Number(n).toLocaleString('id-ID');
        review.textContent = [data.mode === 'test' ? 'SANDBOX / SIMULASI' : 'LIVE / BOOKING NYATA',
          `Kurir: ${data.payload.courier_company} Instant`,
          `Penerima: ${data.payload.destination_contact_name}, ${data.payload.destination_contact_phone}`,
          `Tujuan: ${data.payload.destination_address}`,
          `Pickup: ${data.payload.origin_contact_name}, ${data.payload.origin_contact_phone}`,
          `Tanggal diminta: ${data.date || '-'}`,
          `Tarif terbaru: ${money(data.price)}`,
          `Dibayar pelanggan: ${money(data.paidShipping)}`,
          `Selisih: ${money(data.price - data.paidShipping)}`,
          'Konfirmasi berlaku 90 detik.'].join('\n');
        message.textContent = ''; dialog.showModal();
      } catch (error) { message.textContent = (error as Error).message; }
      finally { disable(false); }
    });
    bookingForm.addEventListener('submit', async event => {
      event.preventDefault();
      if (busy) return;
      disable(true); dialogMessage.textContent = 'Memesan. Jangan tutup halaman atau pesan ulang...';
      try { await request({ action: 'book', token: quoteToken, confirmed: true }); window.location.reload(); }
      catch (error) {
        quoteToken = ''; dialog.close();
        message.textContent = `${(error as Error).message} Muat ulang halaman untuk melihat status tersimpan sebelum melanjutkan.`;
        // A lost response may still have booked a courier. Reload before any new attempt.
        root.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('[data-quote-form]')?.remove();
        disable(false);
      }
    });
    root.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('[data-sync-form]')?.addEventListener('submit', async event => {
      event.preventDefault(); if (busy) return;
      disable(true); message.textContent = 'Memeriksa status Biteship...';
      try {
        await request({ action: 'sync', providerId: new FormData(event.currentTarget as HTMLFormElement).get('providerId') || '' });
        window.location.reload();
      } catch (error) { message.textContent = (error as Error).message; disable(false); }
    });
  }
</script>
<style>
  .shipping dl { margin: 20px 0; }
  .shipping dl > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(140px, 1fr) 3fr; gap: 16px; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--a-line); }
  .shipping dt { color: var(--a-muted); }
  .shipping dd { margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 400; }
  .shipping p { line-height: 1.6; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; }
  .shipping__fields { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  .shipping label { display: block; font-size: 13px; }
  .shipping input:not([type=checkbox]) { display: block; width: 100%; min-height: 42px; margin-top: 6px; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--a-line); border-radius: 8px; font: inherit; font-weight: 400; color: var(--a-ink); background: white; }
  .shipping input:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--a-accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .shipping form { margin-top: 20px; }
  .shipping__error { color: #a32e2e; }
  .shipping__balance { margin: 16px 0 20px; padding-left: 14px; border-left: 3px solid var(--a-line); }
  .shipping__balance p { margin: 10px 0; }
  .shipping__balance summary { cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; }
  dialog { width: min(600px, calc(100% - 32px)); max-height: calc(100dvh - 48px); overflow: auto; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 8px; color: #333; background: white; }
  dialog::backdrop { background: rgb(0 0 0 / 40%); }
  dialog form { margin: 0 !important; }
  .shipping__check { line-height: 1.7; }
  .shipping__check input { margin-right: 8px; }
  [data-review] { white-space: pre-line; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .shipping__actions { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 24px; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .shipping__fields { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .shipping dl > div { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; } }
</style>
